{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle Royale on another level. Enjoy faster and more intense battles with SUPER PEOPLE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is a new form of a Battle Royale Shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SUPER PEOPLE is a Battle Royale Shooter where you play as one of the Super Soldiers with various skills and compete to become the last man or last trio standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make your character stronger in various ways as the game progresses. Class-specific skills and ultimates can be learned and used as your character levels up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the thrill and excitement of turning the tide in an instant with faster means to acquire ultimates. The ever-so-different gameplay for each round adds another flavor to its unique experience one cannot get from playing other Battle Royale shooters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engagements can occur at any time, anywhere, so the process of planning a route to get the best equipment can be seen as a strategy and a fun element.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3619270?t=1746596606","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619270/23d319a6d9c973bdc0318246d95b5f3c6a8baf48/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746596606","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619270/e5f76b9662d2fed60f59ac888844ec574ad7a777/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746596606","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619270/e5f76b9662d2fed60f59ac888844ec574ad7a777/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746596606","content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>For Closed Beta Test applicants</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At WONDER PEOPLE, our mission is to create a game that can change the world \u2014 and we want to walk this journey together with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As passionate gamers ourselves, our ultimate goal is to deliver experiences that bring true joy to players all around the globe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019ve watched with excitement as the battle royale genre reshaped the gaming landscape. Now, with our own unique WONDER twist, we\u2019re working hard to reintroduce SUPER PEOPLE \u2014 bigger, better, and more thrilling than ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s been a long road to get here, but we\u2019re back with a renewed vision. And we\u2019re still refining and improving every step of the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through this upcoming test, we\u2019re eager to hear your thoughts, take your feedback to heart, and use it to shape the future of our content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We hope you\u2019re just as excited to dive into AAA-quality SUPER PEOPLE on Steam, and we sincerely invite you to jump in and play.</p></p><br><h1>You are invited to the mysterious island, &quot;Orb Island.&quot;</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are lot of hidden environments and secrets on Orb Island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout the island where all the action takes place, there are beautiful villages, research facilities, and diverse ecological environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Among them are mysterious locations and special landmarks that hold many secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you explore the island, you must familiarize yourself with all the tactical choke points, advantageous grounds for combat, and how to acquire good gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Orb Island is surrounded by fierce snow storms that will close in on the map as the match progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move quickly to secure useful items and find safety from the snowstorm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is also helpful to be on the lookout for any developments in your vicinity and to react quickly to it.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle Royale on another level. Enjoy faster and more intense battles with SUPER PEOPLE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is a new form of a Battle Royale Shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SUPER PEOPLE is a Battle Royale Shooter where you play as one of the Super Soldiers with various skills and compete to become the last man or last trio standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make your character stronger in various ways as the game progresses. Class-specific skills and ultimates can be learned and used as your character levels up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the thrill and excitement of turning the tide in an instant with faster means to acquire ultimates. The ever-so-different gameplay for each round adds another flavor to its unique experience one cannot get from playing other Battle Royale shooters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engagements can occur at any time, anywhere, so the process of planning a route to get the best equipment can be seen as a strategy and a fun element.</p>","developers":["Wonder People"],"drm_notice":"BattlEye<br>None machine activation limit","genres":[{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619270/6e8ca9b3053f2bfb7b6011494a6ddcaf365cc551/header.jpg?t=1746596606","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u24d2 Wonder People Co.,Ltd. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257136218,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136218/movie480.mp4?t=1746596604","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136218/movie_max.mp4?t=1746596604"},"name":"Teaser trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257136218/7498a9d5ebf0bea3e80b499eacc9a8a79d77e57f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746596604","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136218/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746596604","max":"http: